ters into their own hands to determine the source of the virus before it spreads; Dr. Jaax convinces an employee to hand over samples from infected monkeys.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h3m5jRrsWDt3WRPvQ3mpvcZbooh.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLUhvdC1ab25lLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTktJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.3","title":"Charlie Foxtrot","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2019-05-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When representatives from varying agencies disagree on how to handle Dr. Nancy Jaax's discovery, she realizes there are few protocols in place for containing a deadly virus on U.S. soil; an employee at the monkey research facility falls ill.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6Sake589vK5MJw2REXWSUyGRsXq.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLUhvdC1ab25lLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTktJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.4","title":"Expendable","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2019-05-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"An employee at the monkey research facility falls ill, causing Dr. Nancy Jaax to fear the virus has spread to the human population; Jerry Jaax searches for a way to protect his wife; Dr. Wade Carter is obsessed with exposing the dangers of Ebola.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8RW9shggZ0qOR0jGfApnPOPTdJg.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLUhvdC1ab25lLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTktJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.5","title":"Quarantine","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2019-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dr. Nancy Jaax works tirelessly to find out why the virus is behaving differently than expected in human victims; unforeseen dangers arise at the research facility; Jaax is forced to make a choice between her family and her duty to her country.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uH2VtVvZehrABy4Z8n7ltB0Ttuf.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLUhvdC1ab25lLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTktJTI5LTcyMHAv.1.6","title":"Hidden","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2019-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A volatile situation inside the research facility comes to a head; Dr. Jaax steps up, but exhaustion threatens the precision needed to sterilize the threat; the press arrives, and neighbors become aware of the danger next door.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oSC5P2MkDsxn83nSbXQZRf7s2yA.jpg"}]}}